      "title": "DD 1561 - FSA-T, Back-to-Back TAD (8g Was)",
      "description": "FSA-T for a married sergeant with a child redeploying on TAD after a 45-day TAD (5 Jan to 18 Feb 26) and 27 days at home station: the 44-day redeployment from 18 Mar to 30 Apr 26 continues the earlier period, 71 days in all (DoD FMR Vol 7A Ch 27 par 4.4.2). Sample data - replace before use.",
